      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "\"怎么不说话呀？\"",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Why aren't you saying anything?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p00689",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "柏木冲着默不作声的我说道，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Kashiwagi said to me as I sat there in silence,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p00689",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "\"特地为你带来了一位姑娘，可你……",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I went out of my way to bring a girl here for you, and yet you...",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p00689",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "你是担心她会耻笑你的结巴吗？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Are you worried that she will laugh at your stutter?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p00689",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "结巴！给巴！说不定她就迷上你的结巴呢？\"",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Your stutter! Your stutter! Who knows, she might even fall for your stutter.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
